module.scenes.row.add-args.help = The exact arguments, separated by spaces; put a word with spaces in "double quotes". They are part of what you approve.
module.scenes.row.add-undo.header = Put back by
module.scenes.row.add-undo.help = Recorded: the module tells Rigbay what the value was, and Rigbay sets it back. A command: you write the command that undoes this one (steam-bypass off). Nothing: the step stays when the game ends.
